#. 6.6->settings-schema.json->section_resume_detect->title
msgid "Resume Detection"
msgstr ""

#. 6.6->settings-schema.json->resume_detect_label->description
msgid ""
"How to detect when the system exits sleep/hibernation/suspension mode.\n"
"- Simple: No graphics activity or changes in the screen saver's state will "
"be detected.\n"
"- Graphics: Graphics activity will be detected.\n"
"- Screen Saver: Changes in the screen saver's state will be detected.\n"
" - Both: Graphics activity and changes in the screen saver’s state will be "
"detected.\n"
"\n"
"Any method other than “Simple” may cause slight flickering, especially "
"during startup."
msgstr ""

